<section class="section acttwo" id="why-us" aria-labelledby="acttwo-title">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <div class="acttwo__inner reveal">
      <h2 class="acttwo__title" id="acttwo-title">
        We get paid to find your waste, not sell you a box.
      </h2>

      <p class="acttwo__body">
        Every vendor in this industry gets paid to install their box. We don't.
        Energy Plus is an <span class="em">Independent Energy Solutions
        Partner</span>. We don't manufacture equipment and we don't sell a box,
        so when we tell you where your money is leaking, there's no product
        hiding behind the diagnosis.
      </p>
      <p class="acttwo__body">
        The verification is the product. The equipment is just whatever the
        verification points to. Because we are not tied to a single product, we
        are free to size and configure the stack to your building's actual
        loads, distortion profile, and utility, instead of to whatever we happen
        to sell.
      </p>
      <p class="acttwo__refrain">
        We don't work for the vendors. We work for you.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

